title Cassette: settings (board CassetteSettings) opened with S: the top, then scrolled; a drag that starts on a label, a switch, a slider or the gap between rows scrolls the list; Esc comes back
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO idle
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 500
key s
wait 400
expect text "Input level"
expect text "Auto gain (card)"
shot settings-top
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
scrollmark
dragon "Codec" -0.12
expect scrolled
say a drag that starts on a row label scrolled the list
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
wait 400
scrollmark
@480x320 drag 0.86 0.52 0.86 0.30
@640x480 drag 0.86 0.53 0.86 0.33
@320x480 drag 0.82 0.37 0.82 0.20
expect scrolled
say a drag that starts on a switch scrolled the list
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
wait 400
scrollmark
@480x320 drag 0.65 0.375 0.65 0.15
@640x480 drag 0.65 0.38 0.65 0.18
@320x480 drag 0.53 0.27 0.53 0.10
expect scrolled
say a drag that starts on the slider scrolled the list
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
drag 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.95
wait 400
scrollmark
@480x320 drag 0.30 0.3075 0.30 0.10
@640x480 drag 0.30 0.311 0.30 0.12
@320x480 drag 0.30 0.2075 0.30 0.10
expect scrolled
say a drag that starts in the gap between two rows scrolled the list
drag 0.5 0.4 0.5 0.05
drag 0.5 0.4 0.5 0.05
wait 600
shot settings-scrolled
expect text "Auto-split"
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
key esc
wait 300
expect text "SOFT"
expect notext "Auto-split"
say Esc came back to the recorder
expect noquit
